Selection rule (crates/px-xtask/src/gates/vendor_test262.rs):

1. Only `*.js` files under test/. Excluded by directory:
  - test/intl402/ (Intl is absent in v1 (ADR 040))
  - test/staging/ (staging tests are unstable and engine-specific)
  - test/harness/ (tests of the harness files themselves, not of the language)
  - test/built-ins/Temporal/ (Temporal is absent in v1 (ADR 040))
  - test/built-ins/ShadowRealm/ (ShadowRealm proposal, not shipped)
  - test/built-ins/SharedArrayBuffer/ (SharedArrayBuffer is absent in v1 (ADR 040))
  - test/built-ins/Atomics/ (Atomics works on SharedArrayBuffer, absent in v1)
  - test/built-ins/AbstractModuleSource/ (source-phase-imports proposal)
2. Excluded: `*_FIXTURE.js` (module helper files, not tests), files without a
   parsable frontmatter block, files that are not UTF-8.
3. Excluded by flag: `module`. The Phase 10 host runs classic scripts; a
   module loader arrives with the DOM. Annex B is vendored (ADR 040 turns it on).
4. Excluded by feature (a test is dropped when ANY of its `features:` matches):
   - case-insensitive prefix: temporal, intl, webassembly, sharedarraybuffer, atomics, shadowrealm
   - every entry of the "Proposed language features" section of the checkout's
     features.txt (stage 3 and below)
   - needs a module loader: dynamic-import, import.meta, top-level-await, json-modules, import-attributes, export-star-as-namespace-from-module, arbitrary-module-namespace-names
   - needs a host object or capability we do not provide: IsHTMLDDA, host-gc-required
5. Excluded: any test with a `locale:` field, any test using `$262.agent` or
   including atomicsHelper.js, any test whose `includes:` names a harness file
   that is not in the checkout.
